ন)।',false,'ok',41),array('math','A person has to cover a distance of 6 km in 45 minute. If he covers one-half of the distance is two-thirds of the total time, to cover the remaining distance in the remaining time, his speed (in km/hr) must be:',array('15','6','8','12'),3,'প্রথম 3 km যায় 30 মিনিটে; বাকি 3 km এর জন্য বাকি 15 মিনিট = 1/4 ঘণ্টা; বেগ = 3 ÷ (1/4) = 12 km/h।',false,'ok',42),array('math','If 25% of a number is subtracted from a second number, the second number resuces to its five-sixth. What is the ratio of the first number to the second number?',array('1 : 3','3 : 2','2 : 3','None of these'),2,'b − a/4 = 5b/6 ⇒ a/4 = b/6 ⇒ a/b = 4/6 = 2/3; অনুপাত 2 : 3।',false,'ok',43),array('math','A is 30% more efficient than B. How much time will they, working together, take to complete a job which A alone could have done in 23 days?',array('21 days','11 days','13 days','None of these'),2,'A ও B এর দক্ষতার অনুপাত 13 : 10। একসাথে দক্ষতা 23 ভাগ, যা A এর 13 ভাগের 23/13 গুণ; সময় = 23 × 13/23 = 13 দিন।',false,'ok',44),array('math','The ratio of two numbers is 3 : 4 and their H.C.F is 4, Their L.C.M is:',array('12','16','48','24'),2,'সংখ্যা দুটি 3×4 = 12 ও 4×4 = 16; ল.সা.গু. = 3 × 4 × 4 = 48।',false,'ok',45),array('math','Tk. 800 becomes Tk. 956 in 3 years at a certain rate of simple interest. If the rate of interest is increased by 4%, what amount will Tk. 800 become in 3 years?',array('Tk. 1052','Tk. 1020.80','Tk. 1025','None of these'),0,'সুদ 156 টাকা, তাই হার = 156/(800×3) = 6.5%। নতুন হার 10.5%: সুদ = 800 × 0.105 × 3 = 252; সবমোট 1052 টাকা।',false,'ok',46),array('math','The average of five consecutive odd numbers is 61. What is the difference between the highest and lowest numbers?',array('2','8','5','None of these'),1,'সংখ্যাগুলো 57, 59, 61, 63, 65; পার্থক্য 65 − 57 = 8।',false,'ok',47),array('math','What mathematical operation should come at the place of "?" in the equation: 2 ? 6 - 12 + 4 + 2 = 11',array('+','x','-','÷'),1,'লেখা অনুযায়ী কোনো চিহ্নেই 11 হয় না; মূল